AI ke faisle logon ki zindagi par asar dalte hain, is liye akhlaqiyat AI ko faidemand rakhti hai:
- bias aur imtiyazi sulook se bachao (insaf);
- privacy aur user data ki hifazat;
- jawabdeh, shaffaf aur mehfooz system, jis se bharosa banta hai.

Qawaneen ke baghair technology ka ghalat istemal ya na-munsifana nataij ho sakte hain. Qawaneen aur policies:
- batati hain ke data kaise jama, store aur use ho;
- privacy aur logon ke huqooq bachati hain (jaise GDPR);
- munsifana, jawabdeh istemal aur awami bharosa yaqeeni banati hain.
